  <title>Logan Grossman Concrete & Services</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <img src="logo.jpg" alt="LG Concrete Logo" class="logo">
    <h1>Logan Grossman Concrete & Services LLC</h1>
    <p>Family Owned & Operated</p>
    <p>503-510-8463 | CCB#6632906</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Logan Grossman Concrete & Services LLC is a family-owned business proudly serving Oregon with quality concrete work. We’re committed to dependable service, honest work, and durable results.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="services">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Driveways & Sidewalks</li>
      <li>Stamped & Decorative Concrete</li>
      <li>Foundations & Slabs</li>
      <li>Concrete Repair</li>
    </ul>
